WEBVTT

00:30.690 --> 00:32.330
Can I do, do?

01:57.850 --> 01:59.480
Liza?

02:01.220 --> 02:02.750
Y..You're...

02:02.750 --> 02:04.220
Umm...

02:04.220 --> 02:07.330
H..Hiro, Hiro Hiyorimi.

02:08.120 --> 02:09.890
Do you need to talk to Hime?

02:09.890 --> 02:11.990
O..Of course not!

02:11.990 --> 02:14.760
Why would I want to see her ugly mug?!

02:14.760 --> 02:16.700
I just happened to be passing by.

02:16.700 --> 02:18.340
Right.

02:19.070 --> 02:21.240
It's just a coincidence, a coincidence.

02:26.310 --> 02:28.150
Say, Hiro...

02:29.540 --> 02:32.990
Actually, I did come to see her.

02:41.620 --> 02:43.430
Hey! Wait up!

02:51.770 --> 02:54.110
I said wait up, damn it!

03:16.530 --> 03:18.490
Shake her off, Flandre.

03:18.490 --> 03:19.530
Huga.

03:19.530 --> 03:22.240
Hime, that's Liza!

03:24.830 --> 03:26.640
Damn it, wait!

03:32.840 --> 03:33.910
Huga.

03:33.910 --> 03:37.510
Stop!

03:37.510 --> 03:39.150
Woohoo!

03:45.420 --> 03:48.830
Hey, Princess, I have something to tell you!

03:50.630 --> 03:53.440
Don't ignore me! Hey!

03:54.430 --> 03:57.500
You think you can outrun me?!

04:12.680 --> 04:15.250
Hey, Princess.

04:15.250 --> 04:16.880
What?

04:16.890 --> 04:18.690
Where are we?

04:19.390 --> 04:21.590
This is my summer vacation home.

04:21.890 --> 04:23.620
That's not what I meant!

04:23.630 --> 04:27.700
Why did I have to come all the
way here with you guys?!

04:27.700 --> 04:29.500
God, you're annoying.

04:29.500 --> 04:31.330
Nobody put a gun to your head.

04:31.330 --> 04:34.840
Huh? I... I was just...

04:34.840 --> 04:36.470
Just?

04:38.310 --> 04:42.010
The peaceful atmosphere is ruined
with you all around.

04:42.010 --> 04:43.210
What?!

04:43.210 --> 04:44.850
L...

04:45.810 --> 04:48.880
Just come with us to play at the lake tomorrow.

04:48.880 --> 04:50.920
What's with that attitude?

04:50.920 --> 04:54.420
Flandre, we have a jet ski at the dock, right?

04:54.420 --> 04:55.820
Huga.

04:55.820 --> 04:57.630
It will be relaxing.

04:57.930 --> 04:59.300
Like I'd go!

05:00.030 --> 05:02.100
Woohoo!

05:02.100 --> 05:03.700
C..Can you...

05:03.700 --> 05:04.970
What did you say?

05:04.970 --> 05:06.770
Umm, Ms. Liza...

05:06.770 --> 05:08.580
Just call me Liza!

05:09.370 --> 05:11.180
Okay, Liza...

05:11.640 --> 05:13.350
I can't hear you!

05:14.180 --> 05:15.340
Liza!

05:15.340 --> 05:16.980
What?

05:17.550 --> 05:21.380
Please slow down!

05:21.380 --> 05:23.260
No!

05:42.340 --> 05:44.650
Why did I bring Liza here, you ask?

05:45.470 --> 05:47.580
Because I'm merciful.

05:48.510 --> 05:51.150
I'm trying to change her mood some.

05:51.580 --> 05:53.220
Huga.

05:53.980 --> 05:57.260
It seems she needs to talk to me about something.

05:58.090 --> 06:01.190
Huh? Didn't you come here to have fun?

06:01.190 --> 06:03.260
It's not so simple.

06:04.390 --> 06:07.030
Are you still going after Hime?

06:08.430 --> 06:10.380
No, it's not that.

06:11.200 --> 06:13.180
I just have to talk to her.

06:14.400 --> 06:16.210
Talk to her?

06:44.800 --> 06:48.670
Ah, what a nice bath.

06:48.670 --> 06:51.470
I'm glad you're having a good time.

06:51.470 --> 06:54.110
I didn't really plan on relaxing with you guys.

06:54.110 --> 06:55.750
Huga.

06:56.040 --> 06:58.150
Anyway, don't you feel them?

06:59.110 --> 07:01.860
See, that's why you're a princess.

07:02.680 --> 07:04.660
I smell something bad.

07:07.620 --> 07:10.130
Seems there's a few dozen of them too.

07:11.930 --> 07:15.170
Each and every one of them is hostile.

07:15.900 --> 07:17.710
What's going on?

07:17.800 --> 07:21.410
Princess, what have you done?

07:24.410 --> 07:25.570
That's preposterous.

07:25.570 --> 07:29.150
The tribes around here are supposed to be docile.

07:45.690 --> 07:47.700
Wh..What's going on?!

07:47.700 --> 07:48.860
It's the cottage!

07:48.860 --> 07:51.210
The cottage is heading down the bank!

07:54.370 --> 07:57.650
The water! They're trying to pull us into the lake!

08:09.950 --> 08:11.290
This is bad, Hiro.

08:11.290 --> 08:13.090
Get Flandre.

08:13.090 --> 08:16.290
Because she's an android, she weighs a few tons.

08:16.290 --> 08:19.670
If she falls into the mud, we'll never get her out!

08:20.330 --> 08:21.700
We're sinking.

08:21.700 --> 08:24.680
Shut up! I already know that!

08:25.100 --> 08:28.210
We won't last long here. What should we do?

08:32.740 --> 08:35.050
Lady luck is on our side tonight, it seems.

08:43.250 --> 08:45.230
Huga...

08:53.860 --> 08:56.430
Hiro, Liza, you're going too slow.

08:56.430 --> 08:59.740
Shut up! I don't see you paddling!

09:00.770 --> 09:02.580
They're here!

09:31.330 --> 09:34.400
Die, die, die, die, die, die, die!

09:37.010 --> 09:38.810
There are tons of them.

09:41.010 --> 09:42.990
Liza, over there!

09:51.520 --> 09:53.160
Huga...

10:35.460 --> 10:37.200
Well now,

10:37.200 --> 10:40.180
seems they've got us completely surrounded.

10:42.770 --> 10:45.050
The sound of their drumming pains my ears.

10:45.270 --> 10:46.970
Agreed.

10:46.980 --> 10:48.960
That's the first time we've agreed on something.

10:49.810 --> 10:51.280
Damn...

10:51.280 --> 10:55.420
I shouldn't have followed you after all.

11:38.130 --> 11:39.730
Hime...

11:39.730 --> 11:41.800
Mistress Hime!

11:42.700 --> 11:46.670
This is the first time we meet.

11:52.770 --> 11:55.540
I take it you're the chief of this village?

11:55.540 --> 12:00.050
We're a race who have been tragically
banished from the Royal Kingdom

12:00.050 --> 12:04.420
and forced to live amongst the humans.

12:04.420 --> 12:09.870
We will never forget the disservice we've been
given at the hands of the Royal Family!

12:11.160 --> 12:15.060
Oh, it's hatred...
We despise you, Mistress Hime!

12:15.060 --> 12:18.970
How about, instead of talking all that trash,
you tell me your true intentions?

12:18.970 --> 12:21.540
As you haven't killed me yet,

12:21.900 --> 12:24.540
you must be after my power.

12:25.140 --> 12:27.570
You wish to become immortal, do you not?

12:27.580 --> 12:29.380
Or am I mistaken?

12:37.120 --> 12:40.350
Just as I expected, Mistress Hime,
you get straight to the point.

12:40.360 --> 12:45.360
Having immortal bodies will be the best
method for the survival of our race.

12:45.960 --> 12:47.840
Very well.

12:48.830 --> 12:51.030
I shall grant you immortal bodies

12:51.030 --> 12:53.030
Huh? Just like that?

12:53.030 --> 12:55.340
So, who wants to die?

12:57.370 --> 13:02.370
You are correct in thinking that the Royal Family
possesses the ability to bestow half-immortality.

13:02.380 --> 13:05.750
However, it only works on those who have died.

13:05.750 --> 13:07.980
You may not have been aware of this,

13:07.980 --> 13:10.960
but I do not harbor the ability to grant
immortality to the living.

13:11.020 --> 13:13.050
Decide amongst yourselves.

13:13.050 --> 13:15.890
Who will be the first to die?

13:15.890 --> 13:19.260
Or would you like to all try at once?

13:19.260 --> 13:20.900
Well?

13:28.970 --> 13:31.780
What a load of mud!

13:39.750 --> 13:44.150
Don't be fooled by this girl!

13:44.150 --> 13:47.720
She's trying to fool you all.

13:47.720 --> 13:49.360
Stop that!

13:49.360 --> 13:51.390
We've already lost.

13:51.390 --> 13:55.330
We need immortal bodies

13:55.330 --> 14:00.030
For that reason alone, we cannot kill her.

14:00.030 --> 14:03.540
Say what you may,
but I cannot allow this to happen!

14:03.540 --> 14:05.310
Furthermore...

14:06.010 --> 14:07.840
If we allow this girl to escape,

14:07.840 --> 14:12.840
it frightens me to think of what sort of
retribution she'll unleash upon us!

14:12.910 --> 14:18.020
Then, let's settle this according
to the ancient laws, a duel.

14:18.550 --> 14:22.870
If you win, I shall overlook your transgressions.

14:28.860 --> 14:31.800
We've forced royalty into such
an unfortunate situation.

14:31.800 --> 14:33.570
They won't go easy on us.

14:33.570 --> 14:35.700
It's a fair fight.

14:35.700 --> 14:38.550
All will be forgiven if we win.

14:44.380 --> 14:46.360
Ready...

14:46.580 --> 14:48.220
Go!

14:57.260 --> 14:58.900
Hiro!

15:07.470 --> 15:08.670
Is he dead?

15:08.670 --> 15:11.070
Dead as a doornail.

15:11.070 --> 15:13.950
What are you looking at?!

15:22.650 --> 15:24.990
I will be your opponent.

15:25.820 --> 15:29.020
My name is Liza Wildman.

15:29.020 --> 15:32.690
I'm the daughter of the great werewolf warrior,
Worg Wildman!

15:32.690 --> 15:35.260
I accept the task of being the Princess's proxy.

15:35.630 --> 15:37.910
I challenge you to a duel!

15:40.170 --> 15:43.640
I'll win no matter who I'm fighting against!

15:44.310 --> 15:46.750
Bring it, you rotten fish.

16:21.340 --> 16:23.480
Just kidding.

16:23.480 --> 16:26.480
Those attacks won't work on me.

16:28.580 --> 16:30.980
Now, the finishing blow!

16:30.990 --> 16:34.630
Let go! Let go of me! Damn it!

16:46.830 --> 16:49.370
Ow...

17:04.750 --> 17:07.060
I've been waiting for this.

17:18.400 --> 17:21.470
Hey, rotten fish!

17:32.510 --> 17:34.990
Your shoe's untied.

17:41.360 --> 17:44.060
Just kidding!

17:58.810 --> 18:00.310
This is bad.

18:00.310 --> 18:02.790
She has him mounted!

18:21.500 --> 18:25.170
No one can go blow-for-blow with
a werewolf under a full moon.

18:25.170 --> 18:27.270
Liza is going to win this duel.

18:27.270 --> 18:31.340
Huh? That means we...

18:31.340 --> 18:33.650
Your transgressions mean nothing to me.

18:34.080 --> 18:38.020
It's not as if I don't understand your
hatred towards the Royal Family.

18:38.750 --> 18:40.450
Just water under the bridge.

18:40.450 --> 18:42.430
Because we're fish?

18:47.220 --> 18:53.370
One, two, one, two, one, two..

19:00.100 --> 19:01.870
Princess,

19:01.870 --> 19:03.970
I have a favor to ask of you.

19:03.970 --> 19:05.270
Consider it done.

19:05.270 --> 19:07.670
I haven't even told you what it is!

19:07.680 --> 19:10.280
I read through you from the start

19:10.280 --> 19:12.050
There's no need to say it.

19:14.150 --> 19:16.420
Now you're just being difficult.

19:16.420 --> 19:17.730
Let me say it.

19:18.490 --> 19:22.560
You may be the one who killed my brother.

19:22.560 --> 19:25.730
However, my enemy is someone else.

19:25.730 --> 19:30.970
It's the one who used me as a hostage to
provoke my brother into attacking you.

19:31.670 --> 19:36.810
I'm aware that your siblings in the
Royal Family are trying to off each other.

19:37.310 --> 19:40.980
I'm also aware that one of your siblings
is calling the shots.

19:42.010 --> 19:44.980
That's the person I'm going to kill.

19:44.980 --> 19:47.110
But to do that...

19:47.110 --> 19:49.750
You need us to work together.

19:50.420 --> 19:54.990
If we do that, you'll get your chance eventually
Am I right?

19:55.420 --> 19:57.260
Yes, you're right.

19:57.260 --> 20:02.260
Is that okay, though?

20:02.530 --> 20:04.340
It's fine.

20:11.670 --> 20:14.040
You're a warrior too.

20:14.040 --> 20:16.780
You live on the battlefield.

20:17.910 --> 20:19.720
Isn't that right?

20:20.380 --> 20:21.850
I'm not sure.

20:21.850 --> 20:24.680
I'm a half-breed.

20:24.690 --> 20:27.000
It means I'm half human.

20:29.260 --> 20:32.290
We caught something!

20:33.230 --> 20:34.870
Huga.

20:35.330 --> 20:37.830
Got one here too!

20:37.830 --> 20:40.240
Will Hiro be all right?

20:40.770 --> 20:44.170
He was soaking in the water all night.
He should be fine.

20:44.170 --> 20:46.640
Are you sure he'll be all right?

20:46.640 --> 20:48.280
Probably.

20:48.910 --> 20:53.910
Mistress Hime, we're deeply sorry for
the disrespect we've shown you.

20:54.620 --> 20:58.390
We're extremely grateful for your mercy.

20:58.390 --> 21:01.660
Though we will never serve the
Royal Family again,

21:01.660 --> 21:05.960
if you personally ever need our
help for anything at all,

21:05.960 --> 21:09.100
all you need to do is ask!

21:09.100 --> 21:11.130
Hi, Liza.

21:11.130 --> 21:12.900
When are you coming back to see me?

21:12.900 --> 21:14.710
Stay away from me!

21:16.240 --> 21:19.610
Farewell!

21:19.610 --> 21:20.610
Your turn

21:20.610 --> 21:24.080
Farewell!

21:30.650 --> 21:34.620
It's delicious.
Your Earl Grey is without rival, Sawawa.

21:34.620 --> 21:36.430
You're too kind.

21:41.360 --> 21:44.200
Hiro, whatcha doin' here?

21:44.200 --> 21:46.700
Huh? Oh, Liza.

21:46.700 --> 21:49.140
Let's go eat some shaved ice.

21:49.140 --> 21:51.950
Huh? Actually, I'm in the middle of work...

21:53.540 --> 21:56.140
No excuses, let's go!

21:56.140 --> 21:57.540
What?!

21:57.550 --> 22:01.410
H..Hey... W..Wait a sec...

22:01.420 --> 22:03.620
H..Hold on, Liza!

22:03.620 --> 22:06.260
Liza!

23:40.510 --> 23:41.510
Hug;-a?

23:41.520 --> 23:43.620
At my school, Sasanaki Academy,

23:43.620 --> 23:48.120
there's a student who's the envy of all the boys
and girls, my senior, Reiri Kamura.

23:48.120 --> 23:50.820
So, why is she talking to me?

23:50.820 --> 23:52.460
Lil' ole me...

23:53.430 --> 23:55.400
You're drooling, Hiro.

23:55.400 --> 23:56.970
H..Hime!

23:57.700 --> 23:59.370
Don't get the wrong idea.

23:59.370 --> 24:02.140
She's an evil enchantress.

24:02.140 --> 24:04.540
Next episode, "Princess Bloodline"

24:04.540 --> 24:06.270
An enchantress, huh?

24:06.270 --> 24:06.670
Doesn't sound so bad.

24:07.540 --> 24:09.280
Huga, huga.
